"""CK: machine check of the stack statements S1-S7 (file, line, phrase) and candidate C7.

Run from RL/work/CK:  /tmp/oph-completion-venv/bin/python -B ck_statements.py
Writes statements_check.json and c7.json. Each entry: group, file, claimed line, phrase, status tag.
A phrase passes when it occurs within 6 lines of the claimed line; otherwise the first line where it occurs is reported.
"""
